          "alt": {
            "en": "A smooth smiling statue with her palm turned up while an old woman traces a letter in the dust",
            "hi": "चिकनी मुस्कराती प्रतिमा, हथेली ऊपर किए; धूल में अक्षर खींचती दादी"
