            "en": "“उल्लेखः,” you say, “a mention,” and the eleventh statue turns her palm over, and in it, very small, lies a seed. “सज्जनः,” she says. “तच्च. उल्लेखः.” She closes her hand, and her calm smile deepens, because somewhere, on her very smooth stone, a sound has found its place.",
